; Like beancount's parser, a negative price is reported and made positive,
; and a total price on a posting without units is reported and dropped;
; each transaction then fails to balance.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-03 * "units missing total price"
  Assets:A      HOOL @@ 10 USD
  Assets:Cash  -10 USD

2020-01-04 * "negative per unit"
  Assets:A      2 HOOL @ -3 USD
  Assets:Cash  6 USD

2020-01-05 * "negative total"
  Assets:A      4 HOOL @@ -10 USD
  Assets:Cash   10 USD
